  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.5\n - Core mapper stabilized; fast reflection-based mapping with recursion for complex types\n - Multi-target: netstandard2.0, netstandard2.1, net8.0, net9.0\n - Collection mapping and list sync helpers (SyncResult)\n - Thread-safe caching and embedded symbols (snupkg)\n - Docs refreshed; known limits: no circular reference handling; ForMember captured but not emitted",
